  "limitations": [
    "Physical work reduction is deterministic. Short sequential latency observations on a shared Mac with other work and swap are not a controlled causal speedup or steady-state qualification.",
    "Three 1-vCPU/3-GiB/no-swap Cellar containers and RustFS in the owned cellar-multi-raft Colima profile; all exact containers stopped and volumes retained. Other profiles were unchanged.",
    "RustFS does not qualify real Amazon S3. The same durability profile still requires quorum/image publication, exact object readback and archive head proof.",
    "Repeated full-image digest scans, object reads, archive polling and competing publisher costs remain; this change removes intermediate image publication/copy/reclamation work only."
  ],
